# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 累计等级：总计 <value>{levels_total:1}</>；恩洛斯 <value>{levels_mm6:1}</>、安塔加里奇 <value>{levels_mm7:1}</>、贾达美 <value>{levels_mm8:1}</>、切迪安 <value>{levels_mm9:1}</>。怪物随其他世界累计的等级成长：恩洛斯强化等级 <value>{bolster_mm6}</>、安塔加里奇 <value>{bolster_mm7}</>、贾达美 <value>{bolster_mm8}</>、切迪安 <value>{bolster_mm9}</>。
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:1177
msgid "Levels banked: <value>{levels_total:1}</> in all; <value>{levels_mm6:1}</> in Enroth, <value>{levels_mm7:1}</> in Antagarich, <value>{levels_mm8:1}</> in Jadame, <value>{levels_mm9:1}</> in Chedian. Monsters grow with the levels banked in the other worlds: bolster level <value>{bolster_mm6}</> in Enroth, <value>{bolster_mm7}</> in Antagarich, <value>{bolster_mm8}</> in Jadame, <value>{bolster_mm9}</> in Chedian."
msgstr "累计等级：总计 <value>{levels_total:1}</>；恩洛斯 <value>{levels_mm6:1}</>、安塔格里克 <value>{levels_mm7:1}</>、贾丹姆 <value>{levels_mm8:1}</>、切迪安 <value>{levels_mm9:1}</>。怪物随其他世界累计的等级成长：恩洛斯强化等级 <value>{bolster_mm6}</>、安塔格里克 <value>{bolster_mm7}</>、贾丹姆 <value>{bolster_mm8}</>、切迪安 <value>{bolster_mm9}</>。"

# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 每点技能将手杖伤害提升 2%（每点不低于 1）。宗师级时，徒手技能等级的一半会加到手杖伤害上。从专家级起，手持手杖还会增加护甲等级，并为全队抗性增加同等数值：每点技能取手杖格挡值（显示在手杖上，随手杖威力增长）的下方百分比，并按多 10 点技能计算。{stun_line}{guard_line}
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:723
msgid "Each point raises the damage of the staff by 2 % (never less than 1 per point). At Grandmaster, Unarmed adds half its skill to a staff's damage. From Expert, a staff in hand also adds Armor Class, and as much to the whole party's resistances: the percent below of the staff's guard (shown on the staff; it grows with the staff's power) for each point of skill, counted as if you had 10 more points. {stun_line}{guard_line}"
msgstr "每点技能将手杖伤害提升 2%（每点不低于 1）。宗师级时，空手搏斗术等级的一半会加到手杖伤害上。从专家级起，手持手杖还会增加防御等级，并为全队抗性增加同等数值：每点技能取手杖格挡值（显示在手杖上，随手杖威力增长）的下方百分比，并按多 10 点技能计算。{stun_line}{guard_line}"

# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 每点 +2 攻击；每点获得格挡值 2% 的护甲等级与全队抗性
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:729
msgid "Attack +2 per point; Armor Class and party resistances 2 % of the guard per point"
msgstr "每点 +2 攻击；每点获得格挡值 2% 的防御等级与全队抗性"

# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 每点 +3 攻击；每点获得格挡值 3% 的护甲等级与全队抗性；有几率使目标麻痹 2 秒
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:730
msgid "Attack +3 per point; Armor Class and party resistances 3 % of the guard per point; a chance to paralyse for 2 s"
msgstr "每点 +3 攻击；每点获得格挡值 3% 的防御等级与全队抗性；有几率使目标麻痹 2 秒"

# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 每点 +4 攻击；每点获得格挡值 4% 的护甲等级与全队抗性；可与徒手技能并用，麻痹持续 4 秒
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:732
msgid "Attack +4 per point; Armor Class and party resistances 4 % of the guard per point; usable with Unarmed, paralysis lasts 4 s"
msgstr "每点 +4 攻击；每点获得格挡值 4% 的防御等级与全队抗性；可与空手搏斗术并用，麻痹持续 4 秒"

# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 每点技能将剑、武器精通与特殊能力伤害提升 2%（每点不低于 1）。从大师级起，手持剑还会增加护甲等级：每点技能取剑的格挡值（显示在剑上，随剑的威力增长）的下方百分比，并按多 10 点技能计算。{guard_line}
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:735
msgid "Each point raises the damage of the sword, Armsmaster and special abilities by 2 % (never less than 1 per point). From Master, a sword in hand also adds Armor Class: the percent below of the sword's guard (shown on the sword; it grows with the sword's power) for each point of skill, counted as if you had 10 more points.{guard_line}"
msgstr "每点技能将长剑、武器使用术与特殊能力伤害提升 2%（每点不低于 1）。从大师级起，手持长剑还会增加防御等级：每点技能取长剑的格挡值（显示在长剑上，随长剑的威力增长）的下方百分比，并按多 10 点技能计算。{guard_line}"

# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
