#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:741
msgid "Attack +3, speed +1 % per point; Armor Class 1 % of the guard per point; can dual wield"
msgstr "每点 +3 攻击、+1% 速度；每点获得格挡值 1% 的防御等级；可双持"

# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 每点 +4 攻击、+2% 速度；每点获得格挡值 2% 的护甲等级
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:742
msgid "Attack +4, speed +2 % per point; Armor Class 2 % of the guard per point"
msgstr "每点 +4 攻击、+2% 速度；每点获得格挡值 2% 的防御等级"

# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 每点技能将矛、武器精通与特殊能力伤害提升 2%（每点不低于 1）。从专家级起，手持矛还会增加护甲等级：每点技能取矛的格挡值（显示在矛上，随矛的威力增长）的下方百分比，并按多 10 点技能计算。{guard_line}
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:761
msgid "Each point raises the damage of the spear, Armsmaster and special abilities by 2 % (never less than 1 per point). From Expert, a spear in hand also adds Armor Class: the percent below of the spear's guard (shown on the spear; it grows with the spear's power) for each point of skill, counted as if you had 10 more points.{guard_line}"
msgstr "每点技能将长矛、武器使用术与特殊能力伤害提升 2%（每点不低于 1）。从专家级起，手持长矛还会增加防御等级：每点技能取长矛的格挡值（显示在长矛上，随长矛的威力增长）的下方百分比，并按多 10 点技能计算。{guard_line}"

