# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 每点 +8 攻击；每点获得格挡值 8% 的护甲等级；每次命中使目标额外受到 {spear_stack}% 物理伤害，叠加至目标死亡（使用戟时效果再增加一半）
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:768
msgid "Attack +8 per point; Armor Class 8 % of the guard per point; each blow makes the target take {spear_stack}% more physical damage, stacking until it dies (half again with a halberd)"
msgstr "每点 +8 攻击；每点获得格挡值 8% 的防御等级；每次命中使目标额外受到 {spear_stack}% 物理伤害，叠加至目标死亡（使用戟时效果再增加一半）"

# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 当前掩护几率：<good>{cover_chance}</>%。掌握度在 <value>{ladder_expert}</>、<value>{ladder_master}</>、<value>{ladder_grandmaster}</> 点自行达成。技能页上其名称旁的宝石（或 P 键）可切换：{cover_state}。
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:893
msgid "Current cover chance: <good>{cover_chance}</> %. Mastery comes by itself at <value>{ladder_expert}</>, <value>{ladder_master}</> and <value>{ladder_grandmaster}</> points. The gem beside its name on the skills page (or P) switches it: {cover_state}."
msgstr "当前掩护几率：<good>{cover_chance}</>%。精通等级在 <value>{ladder_expert}</>、<value>{ladder_master}</>、<value>{ladder_grandmaster}</> 点自行达成。技能页上其名称旁的宝石（或 P 键）可切换：{cover_state}。"

# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 现在每点魔力吸收 <mana>{mana_efficiency:2}</> 点伤害。技能页上其名称旁的宝石（或 M 键）可切换：{mana_shield_state}。
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:898
msgid "Now each spell point absorbs <mana>{mana_efficiency:2}</> damage. The gem beside its name on the skills page (or M) switches it: {mana_shield_state}."
msgstr "现在每点魔法值吸收 <mana>{mana_efficiency:2}</> 点伤害。技能页上其名称旁的宝石（或 M 键）可切换：{mana_shield_state}。"

# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 鲜血（死亡骑士专属）：受到的物理伤害降低 <good>{school_cut:1}</>%。其掌握度可解锁血液吸取、再生术、窒息与高级血液吸取；血液吸取开启时，你的攻击会吸取生命。
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:922
msgid "Blood, only for Death Knights: physical damage taken falls by <good>{school_cut:1}</> %. Its mastery unlocks Blood Leech, Regeneration, Asphyxiate and Superior Blood Leech; while Blood Leech is on, your blows leech life."
msgstr "血液（死亡骑士专属）：受到的物理伤害降低 <good>{school_cut:1}</>%。其精通等级可解锁血液吸取、再生术、窒息与高级血液吸取；血液吸取开启时，你的攻击会吸取生命。"

# reviewed: terms aligned with the v2.1 pack
# was: 龙用尖牙对敌人造成可怕伤害。伤害为 30 + 每级 2（最高 {dragon_level_cap} 级）；獠牙技能按掌握度与技能等级的百分比提升伤害。每点还使撕咬慢 1.5% 但强 1.5%，因此更少、更重的撕咬在相同时间内造成同等伤害。当龙族异能不低于獠牙时，每次撕咬还会击退怪物。
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:983
msgid "Dragons use their fangs to deal atrocious damage to enemies. Damage is 30 + 2 per level (up to level {dragon_level_cap}); the Fangs skill raises it by a percentage of mastery and skill level. Each point also makes the bite 1.5 % slower and 1.5 % stronger, so fewer, heavier bites deal the same damage over time. While Dragon Ability is at least as high as Fangs, each bite also throws the monster back."
msgstr "龙用尖牙对敌人造成可怕伤害。伤害为 30 + 每级 2（最高 {dragon_level_cap} 级）；獠牙技能按精通等级与技能等级的百分比提升伤害。每点还使撕咬慢 1.5% 但强 1.5%，因此更少、更重的撕咬在相同时间内造成同等伤害。当龙族异能不低于獠牙时，每次撕咬还会击退怪物。"

